certificate_invalid.description:
Home Assistant stopped connecting to **{entry_title}** because the remembered certificate is {reason}.

**Fingerprint:** `{fingerprint}`

**Valid from:** {valid_from}

**Valid until:** {valid_until}

Renew or replace the certificate, or choose another certificate-checking method in the integration options.
